'''Phantom Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Z-Onel Rises!]] appearing on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''' and '''22nd''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] increases health, damage and backswing length, reduces recharge, and gains a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] target and [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]].

